        "answer": "Initializes fileshare models and constructs theater header/mode list/recent/bookmarked lists. Header menu_loaded forwards its original handler, sizes safe area off PC and dispatches children only when unhandled. Unlocked mode actions process the list and return true; labels return false when locked. Fileshare filtering occurs in both theater/non-theater branches, with setup only in theater. Optional PreLoadFunc and close wiring retain source order; source presence is not HMH theater invocation.",
