        "answer": "Supplied caller anchor is the Director factory definition itself, so external invocation/HMH menu navigation is unproven. Conditional constructor creates menu, setups default-focus callbacks/any-controller/offline-screen/build-info/companion-app/contracts model, then builds theater/custom/training/arena/public/private/pregame/select and shared/PC-looking children. Direct construction is not authority to reconstruct every other-mode child. Child menu_loaded wrappers use local/super menuLoaded, conditional non-PC safe-area sizing, then dispatch only if unhandled. State predicates: HideForGameStart from LobbyRoot hideMenusForGameStart1; ShowSelectKorea15Plus requires PC+Zombies+opaque Korea eligibility; other states delegate exact DirectorUtility ShowDirectorSelect/Pregame/Private/Custom/Arena/ArenaMatchmaking/Theater/Public/Training. lobbyNav/showSelect/hide flags reevaluate state; network [excerpt; exact source record identified separately]",
